s12:s9,s11:expcld |- ( ( N e. NN /\ k e. ( 1 ... ( N + 1 ) ) ) -> ( k ^ 2 ) e. CC )
s13::id |- ( k = ( N + 1 ) -> k = ( N + 1 ) )
g1:s13:oveq1d |- ( k = ( N + 1 ) -> ( k ^ 2 ) = ( ( N + 1 ) ^ 2 ) )
qed:s3,s12,g1:fsump1 |- ( N e. NN -> sum_ k e. ( 1 ... ( N + 1 ) ) ( k ^ 2 ) = ( sum_ k e. ( 1 ... N ) ( k ^ 2 ) + (   (   N   +   1   )   ^   2   ) ) )
$)
